10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@George, how do we know who to trust? It's so confusing!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,Trust is built on consistency. Watch for sudden changes in behavior.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,That makes sense. I'll try to listen more than I speak.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,A gentle heart sees the truth. Let us be patient with one another.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,I agree. Balance is key. Let's not rush to judgment too quickly.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,But what if we wait too long? The wolves might eat us all!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
